Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 06:03:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 64/76] perf(polynomials): AVX-512 IFMA Horner chains in
 polynomial_arithmetic::evaluate

Sixteen interleaved Horner chains (two registers of eight, step z^16) per thread chunk, the remainder by
scalar Horner. Same value (exact arithmetic), runtime-dispatched.
